OL,3,GNEWSAMarket revamp takes shape ahead of
OL,4,Atraders' return
OL,5,
OL,6,FTalks are taking place with traders
OL,7,Fabout when they can move back to
OL,8,FLeicester's revamped market place.
OL,10,FStalls have been moved to a temporary
OL,11,Fsite in Green Dragon Square while
OL,12,FLeicester City Council carries out a
OL,13,F#9.4m rennovation of the city's market.
OL,15,FSome of the hoardings round the Market
OL,16,FPlace, which have been in place since
OL,17,F2024, have now been removed as the
OL,18,Fproject nears completion.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,364,360,200,160,0,100
