OL,3,GNEWSAMarket revamp takes shape ahead of
OL,4,Atraders' return
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe council previously indicated it
OL,7,Faimed to have traders back on the
OL,8,Fsquare by the end of 2026 but city
OL,9,Fmayor Sir Peter Soulsby has suggested
OL,10,Fit may happen later.
